  "description": "Jo Seong-Wu is college basketball’s biggest star, and Wonse University’s ace, with his sights set on the big league. He’s got talent to spare and an ego to match. Kang Seol-Hyun has idolized him from the bench. A late starter with no flashy résumé or standout build, he makes up for it with relentless grit and a deadly shooting touch. When starting guard Si-Hun goes down with an injury, Seol-Hyun finally gets his shot, right alongside the arrogant star he’s always admired...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
